          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma ga/aaweek, deelo i hardát ar muk'eé' oo Israeli nee oo Yuda nguwa diihhooár i ki/is. Aníng inooín in ki/ís baraá yaamuudá' naa taati'ii'ín i haniís, nee inooín ngiri aaliyá'. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        }
